                    Servicio de emergencia las 24 horas
                  </p>
                </div><div class="text-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-shield-check-line text-2xl text-white"></i>
                  </div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Sin Daños</h3><p
                    class="text-gray-200"
                  >
                    Apertura profesional sin dañar
                  </p>
                </div><div class="text-center">
                  <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4"
                  >
                    <i class="ri-speed-up-line text-2xl text-white"></i>
                  </div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Rápido</h3><p
                    class="text-gray-200"
